{
  "_comment": "The MAIN Surrender script authored in the step model - every one of the 42 nodes from the original node/edge Visio flow is represented in a step below. Architecture (README 21.6, Option A): a script has STEPS; a step has ordered content UNITS (referenced from the library) plus optional onEnter LOGIC (checks/waypoints run before the screen renders); BUTTONS at the end own all navigation. Answering a question/manual-check inside a step captures the answer and reveals dependent units (visibleWhen); it does NOT navigate - only a button click navigates. onEnter entries are { kind:'check', ref } or { kind:'waypoint', id, aggregate, source } (aggregate logic = README 9). A pure decision step has empty content and a single { kind:'auto' } button whose routes are evaluated immediately. A call step invokes a reusable callable flow via callFlow:{ ref, args? } and maps its exits with onExit:{ exitName: stepId } (terminal callable flows need no onExit). Expression language (illustrative): '<checkRef> == v' / '<checkRef>.<field>' (aggregateFlag output) / '<waypointId> == v' / '<contentId>.value' / '<contentId>.answered'. The callable flows referenced by callFlow are realised in step form inside surrender-001.steps.bundle.example.json, which is the complete runnable bundle.",
  "product": "life",
  "requestType": "surrender",
  "scriptId": "surrender-001",
  "version": 3,
  "title": "Surrender Request",
  "startStepId": "st-suspended",
  "steps": [
    {
      "stepId": "st-suspended",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Suspended funds check",
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "ref": "chk.suspended-fund"
        }
      ],
      "content": [],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "auto",
          "kind": "auto",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "chk.suspended-fund == 'Yes'",
              "to": "st-suspended-info"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-alternatives"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-suspended-info",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Suspended funds",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-susp",
          "ref": "prm.suspended-fund",
          "refVersion": 1
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "end",
          "kind": "end",
          "label": "End call",
          "onClick": ["act.log-task-suspended-reqs"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-alternatives",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Alternatives",
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "ref": "chk.allow-alternatives"
        }
      ],
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-alt-intro",
          "ref": "prm.alternatives-intro",
          "visibleWhen": "chk.allow-alternatives == 'Yes'"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-alt-q",
          "ref": "qst.interested-in-alternatives",
          "visibleWhen": "chk.allow-alternatives == 'Yes'"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-alt-choice-confirm",
          "ref": "prm.alt-choice-confirm",
          "visibleWhen": "c-alt-q.answered"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "enabledWhen": "chk.allow-alternatives == 'No' || c-alt-q.answered",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "chk.allow-alternatives == 'No'",
              "to": "st-value"
            },
            {
              "when": "c-alt-q.value == 'part-surrender'",
              "to": "st-partial"
            },
            {
              "when": "c-alt-q.value == 'pup-ph'",
              "to": "st-pup"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-value"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-partial",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Partial surrender form",
      "callFlow": {
        "ref": "partial-surrender-form"
      }
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-pup",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Paid-up / premium holiday info",
      "callFlow": {
        "ref": "pup-ph-info"
      }
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-value",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Policy value & warnings",
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "ref": "chk.policy-value"
        },
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "ref": "chk.policy-features"
        }
      ],
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-value",
          "ref": "prm.value-today"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-warn",
          "ref": "prm.warnings-conditional",
          "visibleWhen": "chk.policy-features.anyWarning == true"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-continue",
          "ref": "qst.continue-or-think",
          "visibleWhen": "chk.policy-features.anyWarning == true"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "enabledWhen": "chk.policy-features.anyWarning == false || c-continue.answered",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "c-continue.value == 'think'",
              "to": "st-signpost-moneyhelper"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-hold"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-hold",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Please hold",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-hold",
          "ref": "prm.pop-on-hold"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "routes": [
            {
              "to": "st-pre-decision"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-pre-decision",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Pre-surrender eligibility",
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "ref": "chk.pre-surrender-flags"
        },
        {
          "kind": "waypoint",
          "id": "wp-pre",
          "aggregate": "all-pass",
          "source": "chk.pre-surrender-flags"
        }
      ],
      "content": [],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "auto",
          "kind": "auto",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "wp-pre == 'fail'",
              "to": "st-fail-form"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-trust-decision"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-trust-decision",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Trust / assignment / bankruptcy",
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "ref": "chk.trust-assigned-bankruptcy"
        },
        {
          "kind": "waypoint",
          "id": "wp-trust",
          "aggregate": "tri-state",
          "source": "chk.trust-assigned-bankruptcy"
        }
      ],
      "content": [],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "auto",
          "kind": "auto",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "wp-trust == 'fail'",
              "to": "st-fail-form"
            },
            {
              "when": "wp-trust == 'amber'",
              "to": "st-trust-manual"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-trust-confirm"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-trust-manual",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Trust / assignment (manual check)",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-trust-manual",
          "ref": "chk.trust-assigned-manual"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "enabledWhen": "c-trust-manual.answered",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "c-trust-manual.value == 'Yes'",
              "to": "st-fail-form"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-trust-confirm"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-trust-confirm",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Confirm trust / assignment / bankruptcy",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-confirm",
          "ref": "qst.confirm-trust-assignment"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "enabledWhen": "c-confirm.answered",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "c-confirm.value == 'confirms-issue'",
              "to": "st-fail-form"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-method"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-method",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Preferred method",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-third-party",
          "ref": "prm.third-party-claim"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-method-intro",
          "ref": "prm.fastest-over-phone"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-which-method",
          "ref": "qst.which-method"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "enabledWhen": "c-which-method.answered",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "c-which-method.value == 'online'",
              "to": "st-website-warn"
            },
            {
              "when": "c-which-method.value == 'phone'",
              "to": "st-ownership-decision"
            },
            {
              "when": "c-which-method.value == 'paper'",
              "to": "st-paper-form"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-website-warn",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Website warnings",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-website",
          "ref": "prm.website-link-warnings"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "routes": [
            {
              "to": "st-scam"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-ownership-decision",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Ownership",
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "ref": "chk.single-joint-ownership"
        },
        {
          "kind": "waypoint",
          "id": "wp-own",
          "aggregate": "single-joint",
          "source": "chk.single-joint-ownership"
        }
      ],
      "content": [],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "auto",
          "kind": "auto",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "wp-own == 'amber'",
              "to": "st-other-ph"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-can-phone"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-can-phone",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Complete over the phone",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-can-phone",
          "ref": "prm.can-complete-phone"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "routes": [
            {
              "to": "st-scam"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-other-ph",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Other policyholder present?",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-other-ph",
          "ref": "qst.other-ph-with-you"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "enabledWhen": "c-other-ph.answered",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "c-other-ph.value == 'yes'",
              "to": "st-speak-ph"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-both-needed"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-speak-ph",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Speak to other policyholder now?",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-speak-ph",
          "ref": "qst.speak-other-ph-now"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "enabledWhen": "c-speak-ph.answered",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "c-speak-ph.value == 'yes'",
              "to": "st-capture-ph"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-both-needed"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-capture-ph",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Capture policyholder names",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-capture-ph",
          "ref": "act.capture-ph-names"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "routes": [
            {
              "to": "st-happy-joint"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-happy-joint",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Happy to continue jointly?",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-happy-joint",
          "ref": "qst.happy-continue-joint"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "enabledWhen": "c-happy-joint.answered",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "c-happy-joint.value == 'yes'",
              "to": "st-can-process"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-signpost-moneyhelper"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-can-process",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Can process the request",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-can-process",
          "ref": "prm.can-process-request"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-things",
          "ref": "prm.things-to-know"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "routes": [
            {
              "to": "st-scam"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-scam",
      "version": 1,
